      "content": "rebuild what though? i have nothing left to rebuild with. it's not just about money or stuff, it's like the whole concept of trying is just broken. i look at the math of my life and it's just a huge loss. i spent two decades playing by the rules and it resulted in zero. i'm just so tired of the effort required just to stay afloat. it feels like i'm just pouring water into a bucket with no bottom.",
