      "content": "it's more than just needing a pause. it's the realization that the game itself is a scam. i've put 20 years into this investment and the ROI is negative. i'm just deep in the hole now. if you're at a point where you realize that continuing to play only guarantees more loss, why would you keep playing? it just feels like the only logical thing to do is to just stop. to just exit the game entirely.",
